{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_22_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"一、十有一年，春，正月，齊人、衞人、鄭人盟於惡曹。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，癸未，鄭伯寤生卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"三、秋，七月，葬鄭莊公。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"四、九月，宋人執祭仲。突歸於鄭。鄭忽出奔衞。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"宋人者，宋公也。其曰人何也？貶之也。曰突，賤之也。曰歸，易辭也。祭仲易其事，權在祭仲也。死君難，臣道也。今立惡而黜正，惡祭仲也。鄭忽者，世子忽也。其名，失國也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"五、柔會宋公、陳侯、蔡叔，盟於折。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"柔者何？吾大夫之未命者也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"六、公會宋公於夫鍾。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_22_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_22","textTraditional":"七、冬，十有二月，公會宋公於闞。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}